.TH IAD\-INFINITE\-LIST 3 "" "iced-adaptive-design 0.1.0" "iced-adaptive-design Manual"
.SH NAME
infinite_list \- See the module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
InfiniteList::new(content: impl Into<Element<'a, M>>, state: &Infinite<Q, T>)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
See the module.
.PP
\fBInfiniteList\fR: content that grows as the user scrolls to its end, or presses "Load more". The state (items loaded, one request in flight, stale answers discarded, the scroll rule) is \fBprimitives::infinite\fR; this widget draws the \fBfooter\fR for each status and tells the app when to load.
.PP
.nf
.RS
InfiniteList::new(rows_column, &self.items)        // &Infinite<Query, Row>
    .on_load_more(Msg::More)                       // \-> self.items.load_next(source, Msg::Loaded)
    .on_retry(Msg::Retry)                          // \-> self.items.load_retry(source, Msg::Loaded)
    .trigger(LoadTrigger::Scroll)                  // or LoadTrigger::LoadMore (a button)
.RE
.fi
.PP
| Status      | Footer                                                  | | \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- | \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\- | | \fBIdle\fR      | nothing (scroll) or a "Load more" button                 | | \fBLoading\fR   | a spinner and "Loading..."                               | | \fBFailed\fR    | the message and a Retry button                           | | \fBExhausted\fR | "No more results" ("No results" if nothing was loaded)  |
.PP
\fBWhen it asks.\fR \fBon_load_more\fR is published only while the state is \fBIdle\fR (so never while loading, failed or exhausted) and, for \fBLoadTrigger::Scroll\fR, while the footer is within \fBthreshold\fR pixels of the bottom of the visible area, decided by \fBshould_load_more\fR. That includes content that does not fill the viewport yet, where a scrollable never reports a scroll position (iced only notifies \fBon_scroll\fR when the content overflows): the footer itself is the sentinel, and it fires again after each page lands, until the viewport is full. The message is published once per idle period.
.PP
The list scrolls by itself (\fBscrolled_window\fR, filling its container); \fBscrolled(false)\fR returns content plus footer for a parent that scrolls.
